1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
BOB: I need you for one more job, Alice. Just one.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
ALICE: You said that last time, kid.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
BOB: The vault at the Meridian. Friday night. Trust me.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
ALICE: Fine. But if this goes wrong, I'm done with you.

5
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
CAROL: (on the phone) I'm in. They don't suspect a thing.

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
CAROL: Tell the captain the raid is on for Friday.

7
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,000
CAROL: You must be Alice. I'm your driver.

8
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
ALICE: Bob didn't mention you.

9
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
ALICE: Welcome to the crew. Don't make me regret it.
